## Why This Is Asked
Tests multi-region graph workloads, consistency, and DR trade-offs between a pure managed graph DB vs a hybrid approach with in-region caching and analytics streaming. It probes Neptune Global Database, Streams, ElastiCache, and OpenSearch integration for real-time surfaces.

## Key Concepts
- Neptune Global Database cross-region replication and single-writer model
- Neptune Streams for change data capture
- ElastiCache Redis caching and per-region invalidation
- OpenSearch as a downstream analytics sink
- DR: RPO/RTO targets and failover orchestration

